course: dictionary
lesson: 3555
title: Female: a word for sex and for people
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Female describes the sex that can have babies or lay eggs. Women and girls are female, and so are many animals. «Most American tarantulas flick itchy barbed hairs at enemies, and female tarantulas can live 20 to 30 years.» The word female tells you which group of tarantulas the sentence is about.
explain: Female can be an adjective, used before a noun: a female lion, a female worker. It can also be a noun on its own. «In ring-tailed lemur groups the females lead, eat first and win most disputes.» Here females means the female lemurs, the whole group of them.
explain: Check the clues around the word. «Many goats have beards, both males and females» puts females next to males, so the sentence is comparing the two sexes. Male is the opposite of female. Ask yourself what the sentence compares, and you will know which one it means.
fact: Female means of the sex that can have babies or lay eggs.
fact: Women and girls are female, and so are female animals.
fact: Female can be an adjective (a female lion) or a noun (a female, females).
fact: In plants, female parts make seeds or fruit.
fact: «All clownfish hatch as males, and the biggest one in a group can turn into the female.»
exercise: «Most American tarantulas flick itchy barbed hairs at enemies, and female tarantulas can live 20 to 30 years.» What does female mean here? | Very large and strong | Hairy and itchy | Living in America | *Of the sex that can have babies or lay eggs
exercise: Which word is the opposite of female? | Lemur | *Male | Goat | Girl
exercise: On a form, you may be asked to tick one box for your sex. Which two choices are usually offered? | Tall or short | Red or blue | Young or old | *Male or female
test: «Many goats have beards, both males and females; most sheep do not.» In this sentence, females means | *Female goats | Lemurs in the wild | Female sheep only | Beards
test: In plants, what do the female parts do? | Give off a strong smell | Hold the plant in the soil | *Make seeds or fruit | Change colour in winter
exam: «In ring-tailed lemur groups the females lead, eat first and win most disputes.» Which is the best meaning of females here? | The fossa hunters that live alone | The cartoon lemur kings | *The female lemurs in the group | Goats and sheep
